\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces The fifteen agents. \textcolor {cop}{\textbf  {Red border}} $=$ a genuine language-model call (eight: Proposer, Reflection, Judge, Analyst, Watcher, Interpreter, Evolution, Meta-review). Grey $=$ deliberately deterministic, following Robin's de-agentification --- the Critic is the type guard and so cannot itself be a model, the Referee ranks by measuring, and an LLM Metrologist could talk itself into admitting its own evidence. \textcolor {cfield}{\textbf  {Green}} $=$ the human: the Engineer patches the substrate from outside the loop, because an agent able to rewrite the simulator can make any hypothesis true.}}{11}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:agents}{{1}{11}{The fifteen agents. \textcolor {cop}{\textbf {Red border}} $=$ a genuine language-model call (eight: Proposer, Reflection, Judge, Analyst, Watcher, Interpreter, Evolution, Meta-review). Grey $=$ deliberately deterministic, following Robin's de-agentification --- the Critic is the type guard and so cannot itself be a model, the Referee ranks by measuring, and an LLM Metrologist could talk itself into admitting its own evidence. \textcolor {cfield}{\textbf {Green}} $=$ the human: the Engineer patches the substrate from outside the loop, because an agent able to rewrite the simulator can make any hypothesis true}{figure.1}{}}
\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces The roster in full. Eight genuine language-model calls; five deliberately deterministic; one part-deterministic (the Grounder's retrieval is reproducible by construction, so a citation can be re-derived); one human. The shared substrate --- the CLI wrapper, the file-based working memory (\texttt  {instruction} / \texttt  {memory} / append-only \texttt  {analysis} / \texttt  {user\_input}), the wall-clock budget, forced seeds and the causality rule with its control slot --- is \texttt  {agents/llm.py}, ported from an earlier exploration loop that had already solved these.}}{12}{table.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:agents}{{1}{12}{The roster in full. Eight genuine language-model calls; five deliberately deterministic; one part-deterministic (the Grounder's retrieval is reproducible by construction, so a citation can be re-derived); one human. The shared substrate --- the CLI wrapper, the file-based working memory (\code {instruction} / \code {memory} / append-only \code {analysis} / \code {user\_input}), the wall-clock budget, forced seeds and the causality rule with its control slot --- is \code {agents/llm.py}, ported from an earlier exploration loop that had already solved these}{table.1}{}}
